	(text "1)	BL DATA SELECT: PLACE JUMPER OVER PINS 1 & 2 OF JP1/JP2 TO\n	SELECT DATA INPUT FROM BACKLIGHTING BUS. PLACE JUMPER\n	OVER PINS 2 & 3 OF JP2/JP3 TO SELECT DATA FROM THE RADAR\n	ALTIMETER CONTROLLER MCU.\n2)	J17 IS USED FOR BOTH AN ENCODER AND LINEAR POTENTIOMETER.\n	DO USE BOTH SIMULTANEOUSLY.\n	USE PINS 1 - 3 FOR THE POT.\n	USE PINS 2 - 4 FOR THE ENCODER.\n3)	SURFACE MOUNT COMPONENTS ARE ALL ON THE BACK SIDE OF THE BOARD.\n4)	THERE ARE THROUGH HOLE COMPONENTS ON BOTH SIDES. PLEASE REFER TO\n	MODEL AND SILKSCREEN FOR PROPER PLACEMENT.\n5)	THIS IS A 6-LAYER PCB."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14.986 45.212 0)
		(effects
